      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, The City of New York, especially in a time of fiscal austerity, must make every effort to create more coherent planning and policies concerning youth services and develop a more coordinated delivery of youth services technique to assist youth development and to prevent and reduce juvenile delinquency; and",
