      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a74. The Youth Board shall be composed of no less than 13 and no more than 28 members appointed by the Mayor who shall be representative of the community. Members will be appointed for four year terms and serve at the pleasure of the Mayor. Members will be unsalaried and receive compensation only for expenses incurred in fulfilling their function. The Chairperson shall be designated by the Mayor and serve at the pleasure of the Mayor.",
